1
00:00:00,710 --> 00:00:03,380
Attention!

2
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:08,970
I will now explain to you the details
of the Trost Recovery Operation!

3
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:11,930
Let me start by introducing this fellow!

4
00:00:12,140 --> 00:00:16,770
This is Eren Jaeger,
a member of the Cadets!

5
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:19,440
He is the successful result

6
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:23,110
of our top-secret Titan
transformation experiments!

7
00:00:23,320 --> 00:00:28,030
In Titan form, he will lift that
giant rock near the front gate,

8
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:30,200
carry it to the wrecked gate,

9
00:00:30,410 --> 00:00:32,240
and seal the hole!

10
00:00:32,450 --> 00:00:34,410
As for you,

11
00:00:34,620 --> 00:00:40,130
you're to defend him from the
other Titans while he carries the rock!

12
00:00:40,330 --> 00:00:42,920
Should this operation succeed,

13
00:00:43,130 --> 00:00:48,930
humanity will have taken back land
from the Titans for the very first time!

14
00:00:49,140 --> 00:00:53,810
Indeed, it may
seem extraordinarily small

15
00:00:54,010 --> 00:00:57,850
when compared to what
humanity has given up this far!

16
00:00:58,060 --> 00:00:59,440
However...!

17
00:00:59,650 --> 00:01:03,150
For humankind,
that single, small step...

18
00:01:03,360 --> 00:01:05,440
...will be a great leap forward!

19
00:01:19,750 --> 00:01:22,040
Eren! Don't you recognize me?!

20
00:01:22,250 --> 00:01:23,880
I'm Mikasa!

21
00:01:24,090 --> 00:01:26,340
Part of your family!

22
00:01:26,550 --> 00:01:28,470
Dodge, Ackermann!

23
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:33,180
What the hell?!

24
00:01:33,390 --> 00:01:36,180
He's just a regular, dumb Titan!

25
00:01:36,390 --> 00:01:37,770
Change of plans!

26
00:01:37,980 --> 00:01:41,650
We're to defend Jaeger from the
other Titans until we can recover him!

27
00:01:41,850 --> 00:01:44,570
He holds a precious chance for humanity.

28
00:01:44,770 --> 00:01:47,320
We can't abandon him just like that!

29
00:01:49,740 --> 00:01:51,570
Where am I?

30
00:01:55,120 --> 00:01:56,740
I'm home...

31
00:01:58,700 --> 00:01:59,790
Jean!

32
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,540
Why isn't he using his ODM gear?!

33
00:02:03,540 --> 00:02:04,460
Oh no!

34
00:02:04,670 --> 00:02:06,670
Don't tell me it's malfunctioning?!

35
00:02:06,880 --> 00:02:08,260
I'll manage somehow!

36
00:02:08,460 --> 00:02:09,840
Mikasa!

37
00:02:10,050 --> 00:02:11,220
What happened to the plan?!

38
00:02:11,430 --> 00:02:12,640
It's failed!

39
00:02:12,840 --> 00:02:16,100
We're fighting because
we can't leave Eren behind!

40
00:02:16,310 --> 00:02:18,430
But there are too many Titans...

41
00:02:18,640 --> 00:02:21,060
At this rate, we'll be wiped out!

42
00:02:24,060 --> 00:02:26,230
From the back of the head
to the nape of the neck...

43
00:02:26,440 --> 00:02:30,360
...one meter high and
ten centimeters across!

44
00:02:32,320 --> 00:02:35,200
Eren... Answer me...

45
00:02:35,410 --> 00:02:40,500
Even though just one step outside
the wall lies a hellish world...

46
00:02:40,700 --> 00:02:46,040
Why did you want to
venture into the outside world?!

47
00:02:47,880 --> 00:02:49,300
Why?

48
00:02:50,760 --> 00:02:51,920
Because...

49
00:02:52,130 --> 00:02:54,590
...I was born in this world!

50
00:03:03,230 --> 00:03:04,650
Eren!

51
00:03:23,290 --> 00:03:28,130
Unknown are the names
of the flowers that have been trampled

52
00:03:28,340 --> 00:03:33,590
Birds have fallen to the earth
and long for the wind

53
00:03:33,800 --> 00:03:38,680
Prayers won't solve anything

54
00:03:38,890 --> 00:03:44,020
Only the will to fight
can change the here and now!

55
00:03:44,230 --> 00:03:49,320
O pigs who laugh at the resolve
to walk over corpses to move forward

56
00:03:49,520 --> 00:03:51,860
Livestock complacency? False prosperity?

57
00:03:52,070 --> 00:03:54,740
Give us the freedom of dying,
starving wolves!

58
00:03:54,950 --> 00:04:00,120
The humiliation of being caged
is what triggers us to fight back

59
00:04:00,330 --> 00:04:05,410
We hunters slaughter prey
beyond the castle walls,

60
00:04:05,620 --> 00:04:10,630
consumed with surging bloodlust,

61
00:04:10,840 --> 00:04:17,760
as our crimson bows and arrows
pierce scarlet holes into the twilight

62
00:04:40,009 --> 00:04:45,014
Primal Desire: The Struggle for Trost, Part 9

63
00:04:52,800 --> 00:04:57,300
Damn... I can't believe I'm
draggin' everyone down...

64
00:05:09,980 --> 00:05:13,230
Will this really work out somehow?

65
00:05:19,200 --> 00:05:21,450
We can't go on, Captain!

66
00:05:22,030 --> 00:05:24,870
It's just us now!

67
00:05:26,410 --> 00:05:28,580
Let's fall back to the rock for now!

68
00:05:33,880 --> 00:05:35,500
Situation report!

69
00:05:35,960 --> 00:05:38,260
Five Titans coming from the gate!

70
00:05:49,850 --> 00:05:53,310
There's no way I can just sit
around and wait until the coast is clear!

71
00:05:53,520 --> 00:05:54,900
Jean!

72
00:05:55,110 --> 00:05:57,360
So his gear is busted!

73
00:05:57,570 --> 00:05:59,190
What's going on?!

74
00:06:01,240 --> 00:06:02,160
Crap!

75
00:06:02,360 --> 00:06:03,660
What the hell?!

76
00:06:03,870 --> 00:06:06,950
Damn it! Of all the times...!

77
00:06:09,370 --> 00:06:11,330
Jean! Stay calm!

78
00:06:14,500 --> 00:06:15,590
Marco!

79
00:06:15,790 --> 00:06:17,630
What are you doing?!

80
00:06:28,930 --> 00:06:29,930
Man!

81
00:06:30,140 --> 00:06:32,060
Don't go causin' trouble for us!

82
00:06:42,650 --> 00:06:46,740
Damn! Why is the trigger so stiff?!

83
00:06:50,330 --> 00:06:51,750
Jean!

84
00:06:55,500 --> 00:06:56,920
Oww!

85
00:06:57,840 --> 00:06:59,210
What are you doing?!

86
00:06:59,420 --> 00:07:02,170
Same to you! Now get outta there!

87
00:07:34,710 --> 00:07:35,920
You guys are damn reckless!

88
00:07:36,130 --> 00:07:37,460
No, you are!

89
00:07:37,670 --> 00:07:39,710
That scared the hell out of me!

90
00:07:41,630 --> 00:07:43,050
Look!

91
00:08:17,710 --> 00:08:18,920
Eren...

92
00:08:19,130 --> 00:08:20,540
Mikasa!

93
00:08:22,500 --> 00:08:23,550
Armin!

94
00:08:23,760 --> 00:08:25,380
Eren prevailed!

95
00:08:25,590 --> 00:08:28,930
He's trying to fulfill
his responsibility now!

96
00:08:29,140 --> 00:08:32,310
Now if we just cover
him until he reaches the gate...

97
00:08:32,510 --> 00:08:34,890
...victory will be ours!

98
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:41,060
Defend him!

99
00:08:41,610 --> 00:08:44,070
Even if it costs us our lives...

100
00:08:44,280 --> 00:08:46,530
...we must let Eren reach the gate!

101
00:08:46,740 --> 00:08:50,280
Do not let the Titans get near him!

102
00:08:50,490 --> 00:08:54,160
We gotta give Eren backup! Keep 'em off him!

103
00:08:56,500 --> 00:08:59,580
You two head to Eren!

104
00:08:59,790 --> 00:09:02,460
That's an order! Is that clear?!

105
00:09:02,670 --> 00:09:04,090
Yes, Sir!

106
00:09:07,840 --> 00:09:08,970
The Mitabi team!

107
00:09:09,180 --> 00:09:10,680
What are you doing?!

108
00:09:10,890 --> 00:09:13,010
The Titans are ignoring us now!

109
00:09:13,220 --> 00:09:16,480
Our only choice is to get close
enough to grab their attention!

110
00:09:16,680 --> 00:09:18,440
Look this way, damn it!

111
00:09:18,640 --> 00:09:23,730
Or else we'll shove our blades
up your smelly asses and kill you!

112
00:09:26,990 --> 00:09:28,990
- Here they come!
- We got two of 'em!

113
00:09:29,200 --> 00:09:32,070
Run! Run for the buildings!

114
00:09:32,280 --> 00:09:33,450
That's insane!

115
00:09:33,660 --> 00:09:36,080
Setting foot down there is suicide!

116
00:09:36,290 --> 00:09:39,460
And they have no way to
fight without horses or buildings!

117
00:09:39,670 --> 00:09:44,670
No... That's the only option now.

118
00:09:47,630 --> 00:09:49,720
Follow Mitabi Team!

119
00:09:49,930 --> 00:09:52,390
Armin. We need to go, too.

120
00:09:55,010 --> 00:09:55,810
This way!

121
00:09:56,010 --> 00:09:57,980
Come get me!

122
00:10:05,610 --> 00:10:07,360
My body feels...

123
00:10:07,570 --> 00:10:10,700
...like it's about to be crushed into a pulp...

124
00:10:12,110 --> 00:10:15,410
Mikasa... Armin...

125
00:10:15,620 --> 00:10:16,870
What are you doing?

126
00:10:17,080 --> 00:10:21,290
You'll end up Titan food if
you walk around down there...!

127
00:10:21,500 --> 00:10:24,460
C'mon! Hurry this way, you slowpoke!

128
00:10:24,670 --> 00:10:26,090
Come get me!

129
00:10:28,760 --> 00:10:30,170
H-Hey!

130
00:10:31,720 --> 00:10:33,140
Mitabi!

131
00:10:39,060 --> 00:10:40,430
Why did you want

132
00:10:40,640 --> 00:10:43,520
to venture into
the outside world?

133
00:10:46,610 --> 00:10:51,320
From the moment
we're born, we're all...

134
00:10:51,530 --> 00:10:52,950
...free...

135
00:10:55,370 --> 00:11:01,330
Some might try to deny that,
but it doesn't matter how strong they are!

136
00:11:02,370 --> 00:11:07,880
Fiery waters... Lands of ice...
Or whatever else!

137
00:11:08,090 --> 00:11:10,340
Whoever gets to see those things

138
00:11:10,550 --> 00:11:14,630
will have the greatest
freedom this world has to offer!

139
00:11:16,350 --> 00:11:18,100
Fight!

140
00:11:18,310 --> 00:11:21,060
If anything is worth
giving your life, it's that!

141
00:11:23,350 --> 00:11:27,480
It doesn't matter how
terrifying the world may be!

142
00:11:29,900 --> 00:11:34,450
It doesn't matter
how cruel the world may be!

143
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:36,660
Fight!

144
00:11:37,280 --> 00:11:38,700
Fight!

145
00:11:39,410 --> 00:11:40,830
Fight!

146
00:11:41,450 --> 00:11:42,870
Fight!

147
00:11:46,500 --> 00:11:48,380
There's still a Titan ahead!

148
00:11:50,050 --> 00:11:52,010
I'll handle this!

149
00:11:54,420 --> 00:11:57,180
Out of the way!

150
00:12:19,070 --> 00:12:22,370
Go, Eren!

151
00:12:23,370 --> 00:12:24,790
Fight!

152
00:12:50,400 --> 00:12:51,980
Everyone...

153
00:12:52,190 --> 00:12:55,690
Your deaths weren't in vain...

154
00:13:01,120 --> 00:13:04,830
Today, for the first time in history...

155
00:13:05,040 --> 00:13:07,710
...humanity has beaten the Titans!

156
00:13:07,910 --> 00:13:09,960
Yellow smoke shell spotted!

157
00:13:10,170 --> 00:13:13,670
It seems the operation...
was a success!

158
00:13:14,920 --> 00:13:17,340
Send in additional reinforcements!

159
00:13:17,550 --> 00:13:20,300
Rescue the Elite Squad!

160
00:13:36,900 --> 00:13:39,280
The remaining Titans are coming!

161
00:13:39,490 --> 00:13:41,070
Head up the wall!

162
00:13:41,280 --> 00:13:43,780
I'll withdraw after I've recovered Eren!

163
00:13:45,580 --> 00:13:47,580
Armin! How's Eren?!

164
00:13:47,790 --> 00:13:50,500
He's unbelievably hot to the touch!

165
00:13:50,710 --> 00:13:54,500
We need to hurry...
and get him up the wall...!

166
00:13:57,340 --> 00:14:00,050
Part of his body is fused to it!

167
00:14:00,260 --> 00:14:02,970
- I can't pull him free!
- Then we'll have to cut!

168
00:14:03,180 --> 00:14:05,600
W-Wait! Please!

169
00:14:17,610 --> 00:14:19,780
Eren! Armin!

170
00:14:39,920 --> 00:14:41,340
Mikasa...

171
00:14:41,550 --> 00:14:42,340
Huh?!

172
00:14:42,550 --> 00:14:44,050
Those are...

173
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:48,810
The wings...

174
00:14:49,020 --> 00:14:50,850
...of freedom...

175
00:14:56,940 --> 00:14:59,610
Hey. You kids.

176
00:14:59,820 --> 00:15:02,900
What exactly is going on here?

177
00:15:08,580 --> 00:15:10,830
Afterward, thanks to the actions

178
00:15:11,040 --> 00:15:15,380
of the Scout Regiment and the
Garrison Regiment's Corps of Engineers,

179
00:15:15,580 --> 00:15:19,880
Wall Rose once
again held the Titans at bay.

180
00:15:22,920 --> 00:15:28,600
Taking out the rest of the Titans
trapped inside Trost took a full day,

181
00:15:28,810 --> 00:15:33,020
during which the wall-mounted
cannons fired nonstop.

182
00:15:35,150 --> 00:15:37,310
Most of the Titans that
had gathered by the wall

183
00:15:37,520 --> 00:15:39,610
were wiped out by explosive shells.

184
00:15:39,820 --> 00:15:45,610
The few that remained were
mostly mopped up by the Scouts.

185
00:15:47,660 --> 00:15:52,250
During this, one 4-meter
Titan and one 7-meter Titan

186
00:15:52,450 --> 00:15:55,830
were successfully captured alive.

187
00:15:56,040 --> 00:15:57,790
However...

188
00:15:58,000 --> 00:16:01,420
207 people were dead or missing,

189
00:16:01,630 --> 00:16:04,630
and 897 were injured.

190
00:16:04,840 --> 00:16:09,010
Although this was the first time
humanity had stopped a Titan invasion,

191
00:16:09,220 --> 00:16:15,730
far too many people had been lost
to celebrate this historic achievement.

192
00:16:36,160 --> 00:16:37,580
Hey...

193
00:16:43,710 --> 00:16:45,300
Are you...

194
00:16:45,510 --> 00:16:47,590
...Marco?

195
00:16:50,510 --> 00:16:53,720
Do you know his name, cadet?

196
00:16:53,930 --> 00:16:55,350
I wondered where he was...

197
00:16:55,560 --> 00:17:00,520
But... he's the last person who would ever...

198
00:17:00,730 --> 00:17:02,440
Marco...

199
00:17:02,650 --> 00:17:04,230
What happened?

200
00:17:05,400 --> 00:17:10,320
D-Did someone... anyone...
see how he went out?

201
00:17:10,530 --> 00:17:12,030
What is his name?

202
00:17:12,240 --> 00:17:15,040
Tell me if you know. Quickly.

203
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:20,250
Do you understand, cadet?

204
00:17:20,460 --> 00:17:23,550
Two days have passed since
we sealed the hole with the rock.

205
00:17:23,750 --> 00:17:27,260
Yet we still haven't
rounded up all the bodies.

206
00:17:27,470 --> 00:17:31,180
At this rate,
an epidemic could break out.

207
00:17:31,390 --> 00:17:34,350
We must prevent a secondary disaster.

208
00:17:34,560 --> 00:17:37,770
There's no time to lament our
comrades' deaths yet.

209
00:17:37,980 --> 00:17:39,600
Understand?

210
00:17:43,570 --> 00:17:49,570
Member of the 104th Cadet Corps
and Captain of Squad 19...

211
00:17:49,780 --> 00:17:52,240
...Marco Bodt.

212
00:17:52,450 --> 00:17:53,580
Marco.

213
00:17:53,780 --> 00:17:56,080
I'm glad you knew his name.

214
00:17:56,290 --> 00:17:58,250
Let's continue.

215
00:18:08,590 --> 00:18:10,880
What is this...?

216
00:18:13,220 --> 00:18:15,260
Leftover Titan vomit.

217
00:18:15,470 --> 00:18:17,520
Apparently they don't
have digestive systems,

218
00:18:17,720 --> 00:18:21,900
so they puke people out like
that once they've had their fill.

219
00:18:22,100 --> 00:18:23,940
You can't be serious...

220
00:18:24,150 --> 00:18:28,690
Damn... There's no way of
telling who's who in there!

221
00:18:32,240 --> 00:18:33,870
I'm sorry...

222
00:18:37,290 --> 00:18:39,580
I'm sorry...

223
00:18:39,790 --> 00:18:41,960
It's no use apologizing.

224
00:18:42,170 --> 00:18:44,380
We need to hurry and give them a funeral.

225
00:19:09,610 --> 00:19:12,070
Have any questions?

226
00:19:13,200 --> 00:19:18,490
Commander Erwin, the head of
the Scouts Regiment's Task Force...

227
00:19:19,660 --> 00:19:21,660
...and Captain Levi!

228
00:19:22,580 --> 00:19:24,000
U-Umm...

229
00:19:26,130 --> 00:19:29,630
Where... am I?

230
00:19:34,550 --> 00:19:38,720
It should be obvious.
Let's just say it's a dungeon.

231
00:19:38,930 --> 00:19:42,560
You're currently in the
custody of the Military Police.

232
00:19:42,770 --> 00:19:47,230
Only just now were
we permitted to see you.

233
00:19:49,900 --> 00:19:50,860
That key...!

234
00:19:51,070 --> 00:19:53,530
Yes. It's yours.

235
00:19:53,740 --> 00:19:55,450
I'll return it later.

236
00:19:55,660 --> 00:20:00,580
Dr. Jaeger's basement,
in your home in Shiganshina...

237
00:20:00,790 --> 00:20:04,330
A secret surrounding
the Titans is there, correct?

238
00:20:04,540 --> 00:20:06,710
Yes. I think so.

239
00:20:06,920 --> 00:20:09,130
That's what my father said.

240
00:20:09,340 --> 00:20:13,420
And you've lost your memory,
and your old man's gone missing...

241
00:20:13,630 --> 00:20:16,300
Pretty convenient story, if you ask me.

242
00:20:16,510 --> 00:20:17,890
Levi.

243
00:20:18,090 --> 00:20:22,020
We've already concluded he
has no reason to lie. You know that.

244
00:20:22,220 --> 00:20:24,230
There is still so little we know,

245
00:20:24,430 --> 00:20:28,730
but for now, I feel the most important
thing is to ask about your intentions.

246
00:20:28,940 --> 00:20:31,690
My intentions?

247
00:20:32,570 --> 00:20:34,780
If we want to check out your home,

248
00:20:34,990 --> 00:20:39,160
we'll need to take back
Shiganshina District along Wall Maria.

249
00:20:40,120 --> 00:20:45,370
Sealing the damaged gate there would
be the best way to accomplish that.

250
00:20:45,580 --> 00:20:48,420
Which means we'll need your Titan ability.

251
00:20:49,670 --> 00:20:53,840
Naturally, it's a Titan
that will determine our fate.

252
00:20:54,050 --> 00:20:57,300
The Colossal Titan
and the Armored Titan

253
00:20:57,510 --> 00:21:00,300
most likely work the same way as you.

254
00:21:01,970 --> 00:21:04,350
Your intentions are the key.

255
00:21:04,560 --> 00:21:08,810
The key to saving humankind from this despair.

256
00:21:11,400 --> 00:21:13,020
I'm...

257
00:21:16,990 --> 00:21:19,360
I'm going to drive out...

258
00:21:19,570 --> 00:21:23,950
...every last one from this world!

259
00:21:24,160 --> 00:21:27,460
Hey. Answer the damn question, you twit.

260
00:21:27,660 --> 00:21:30,290
What do you want to do?

261
00:21:34,630 --> 00:21:37,090
I want to join the Scouts...

262
00:21:37,300 --> 00:21:40,680
...and slaughter every Titan I can!

263
00:21:42,390 --> 00:21:45,220
Ah. Not bad.

264
00:21:49,310 --> 00:21:53,310
Erwin. I'll take responsibility for him.

265
00:21:53,520 --> 00:21:55,820
Let the higher-ups know.

266
00:21:56,030 --> 00:21:58,990
I don't necessarily trust him, though.

267
00:21:59,200 --> 00:22:01,410
If he betrays us or goes out of control,

268
00:22:01,610 --> 00:22:04,120
I'll kill him on the spot.

269
00:22:04,330 --> 00:22:06,290
The top brass won't complain.

270
00:22:06,490 --> 00:22:09,410
Because I'm the only one cut out for this.

271
00:22:09,620 --> 00:22:11,500
You're in.

272
00:22:11,710 --> 00:22:15,040
I'll make you a member of the Scouts.

273
00:22:36,360 --> 00:22:41,280
Your dreams are where your heart is

274
00:22:41,490 --> 00:22:47,540
They're more fragile than life itself

275
00:22:47,740 --> 00:22:52,210
Over and over you cast them aside,
only to find more

276
00:22:52,420 --> 00:22:58,880
Now, rest in peace

277
00:22:59,090 --> 00:23:10,220
Pounding impulses defile the things we wish for

278
00:23:10,430 --> 00:23:20,490
and the more we forget
the more we remember again

279
00:23:20,690 --> 00:23:26,450
In this beautiful, cruel world

280
00:23:26,660 --> 00:23:31,620
all I can do is ask why we're still alive

281
00:23:31,830 --> 00:23:37,340
Oh, with our strength... and our weakness...

282
00:23:37,540 --> 00:23:43,010
what are we going to protect if there's no sense

283
00:23:43,220 --> 00:23:46,640
to anything anymore?

284
00:23:53,480 --> 00:23:55,730
A special court-martial.

285
00:23:55,940 --> 00:23:58,520
After being held in an underground cell,

286
00:23:58,730 --> 00:24:02,150
Eren is dragged into a courthouse
filled with the heads of each regiment.

287
00:24:02,360 --> 00:24:05,382
What happens there will
determine whether he lives or dies.

288
